  "solution": {
    "text": "Assuming proton and antiproton are at rest and let them mutually annihilate.<br />Then the energy per photon:<br />Einstein&#39;s mass energy relation , the energy released is<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Where, <math><mi>c</mi></math> is the speed of light and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>m</mi></math> is mass.<br /><br />Given,<br /><br /><math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.67</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.67</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1.5</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> per photon.<br />Energy for two photons will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>"
  }
